{"run":"1620fc3e-9fb5-44ba-8fbc-a8a5666e6ab6","note":"The Turtle Town (real Haiku director, 2026-11-06): beige day shots inside a 30 m turtle, empty-circle cards, line 15 dropped at render, the ending (hose, mud, slide, splash, sea) on flat grass, Spears cast as a person, Mrs. Pell / Mr. Dunk twice, the wolf 3x the turtle","topic":"we live inside a giant turtle and a big bad wolf with an army of soldiers is hunting it","lengthSec":90,"title":"The Turtle Town","lines":[{"part":"rule","text":"In this town, we live inside a giant turtle that the wolf's soldiers hunt."},{"part":"tour","text":"You see, the shell must be shut by dusk."},{"part":"tour","text":"If it's open, the wolf's soldiers march right in."},{"part":"tour","text":"Mrs. Pell keeps her soup warm on the turtle's back."},{"part":"tour","text":"Mr. Dunk ducks every time the turtle blinks."},{"part":"tour","text":"He's been hit twice. By an eyelid."},{"part":"tour","text":"The bakery bread only rises when the wolf howls."},{"part":"me","text":"I'm Tomo, the smallest kid in town."},{"part":"me","text":"That makes me the only one who fits through the turtle's nostril."},{"part":"me","text":"My little sister Juno thinks I'm a hero."},{"part":"me","text":"I'm not. But I let her think it."},{"part":"me","text":"By our shell door hangs my garden hose."},{"part":"me","text":"Green. Coiled. Super boring."},{"part":"until","text":"Until one night, the hunt began."},{"part":"until","text":"Drums rolled outside. Boom. Boom. Boom."},{"part":"until","text":"The full moon sat huge in the shell window."},{"part":"until","text":"Mr. Dunk had left the shell door open."},{"part":"until","text":"Just a crack. Just enough."},{"part":"until","text":"Spears poked through the gap."},{"part":"until","text":"Then the soldiers poured inside."},{"part":"until","text":"Soup flew. Bread flew. Everybody screamed."},{"part":"until","text":"I squeezed out through the nostril."},{"part":"discovery","text":"I crawled out into the cold night air."},{"part":"discovery","text":"At the turtle's head stood an old stone."},{"part":"discovery","text":"Glowing words were carved in it."},{"part":"discovery","text":"It was the wolf's own truce."},{"part":"discovery","text":"The hunt ends when the turtle touches the sea."},{"part":"discovery","text":"Not when it's caught. Just touches."},{"part":"discovery","text":"Far down the hill, the ocean shone."},{"part":"climax","text":"I ran back and dragged out my hose."},{"part":"climax","text":"I sprayed the hill from top to bottom."},{"part":"climax","text":"Mud. Slick. Shiny. A giant slide."},{"part":"climax","text":"I yelled through the shell door, push!"},{"part":"climax","text":"Mrs. Pell pushed. Mr. Dunk pushed."},{"part":"climax","text":"Even the baker pushed, still holding bread."},{"part":"climax","text":"The turtle groaned and tipped forward."},{"part":"climax","text":"Then it slid. Faster. Faster."},{"part":"climax","text":"Splash!"},{"part":"climax","text":"The wolf howled so loud the bread rose."},{"part":"closer","text":"The truce held. The soldiers marched away."},{"part":"closer","text":"Now we float in the sea at sunrise."},{"part":"closer","text":"Mr. Dunk still ducks. Out of habit."},{"part":"closer","text":"Everyone here lives inside a turtle, and nobody hunts it once it's home."}],"words":[["In",0,0.104],["this",0.139,0.302],["town,",0.36,0.848],["we",0.948,1.064],["live",1.122,1.226],["inside",1.249,1.54],["a",1.563,1.586],["giant",1.644,1.946],["turtle",1.981,2.294],["that",2.317,2.41],["the",2.434,2.503],["wolf's",2.538,2.805],["soldiers",2.875,3.293],["hunt.",3.328,3.699],["You",3.799,3.904],["see,",3.962,4.171],["the",4.194,4.264],["shell",4.31,4.542],["must",4.6,4.763],["be",4.809,4.879],["shut",4.925,5.111],["by",5.158,5.251],["dusk.",5.32,5.738],["If",5.838,5.966],["it's",6.012,6.128],["open,",6.187,6.628],["the",6.802,6.872],["wolf's",6.918,7.162],["soldiers",7.22,7.626],["march",7.707,7.951],["right",8.044,8.439],["in.",8.497,8.799],["Mrs.